  era: "Section 7 \xB7 Mauryan Empire \xB7 c. 321 \u2013 185 BCE"
  title: Kalinga War
  text: Around 261 BCE Ashoka conquered Kalinga, in present-day Odisha. In his Thirteenth Rock Edict he records that a hundred thousand people were killed and a hundred and fifty thousand deported, and expresses deep remorse. He turned from conquest by war to conquest by Dhamma.
